The above notice covers `six-axis.glb`, `eoat-suction.glb` and the six WebP
texture maps in this directory, which are derived from
`assets/3DModels/Six-axis/` and `assets/3DModels/EOATSuction/` in the
Open Industry Project (https://github.com/Open-Industry-Project/Open-Industry-Project).

Modifications, in full: four unused vertex attributes were removed from the two
GLBs and their buffers repacked (see scripts/build-robot-model.mjs); the texture
maps were resampled and re-encoded as WebP. No geometry was altered. Full detail
in THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md at the repository root.
